          "type": "step",
          "id": "treasure-hunting:1i08urk",
          "html": "Go upstairs in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blue_Moon_Inn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blue Moon Inn</a> in south <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock</a>.",
          "text": "Go upstairs in the Blue Moon Inn in south Varrock.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "treasure-hunting:12drkqw",
          "html": "Open the chest in the south-west room for a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pirate_message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pirate message</a>. Read it.",
          "text": "Open the chest in the south-west room for a pirate message. Read it.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "treasure-hunting:wdraei",
          "html": "Go to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Falador_Park\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Falador Park</a> and stand on the east end of the pond, directly west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Statue_of_Saradomin_(Falador)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">statue of Saradomin</a>, indicated by X on the ground.",
          "text": "Go to Falador Park and stand on the east end of the pond, directly west of the statue of Saradomin, indicated by X on the ground.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "treasure-hunting:1bzeqmq",
          "html": "Right-click <i>Dig</i> using the pirate message. Kill the gardener. Alternatively, leave the site for a while and the gardener will be gone.",
          "text": "Right-click Dig using the pirate message. Kill the gardener. Alternatively, leave the site for a while and the gardener will be gone.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "treasure-hunting:q4vgm2",
          "html": "Right-click <i>Dig</i> using the message again.",
          "text": "Right-click Dig using the message again.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
